## Lab Walkthrough

### Delegate Control to a User over an OU(inside ADUC)
- Select 'View' from the top of the screen
- Select 'Advanced Features'
- Right-Click the OU that the user is delegating control over
- in the Delegation of Control Wizard, click 'Next'until you get to the Users and Groups section
- Click Add, type the name of the user/group that is being delegated control, then press 'Next'
- Check the box of the privilege that is to be delegated
- Click Finish to complete the process

### OU Deletion
- Right-Click on OU to be deleted
- Select Properties
- Select the Object Tab
- Uncheck the box that says "Protect object from accidental deletion"
- Select 'OK'
- Right-click the OU/User to be deleted
- Select 'Yes' when prompted to verify the deletion request

